# Quick taps aren't lost to a menu's debounce (firmware-bl616#53): three
# Down taps, 40 ms long and 40 ms apart, move the cursor three rows. In the
# main menu (joy_choice) a whole tap used to fall inside the blind 100 ms
# delay; in Options ("one press, one step") the release and the next press
# both fell inside it, so the press read as the old one still held.
expect-screen "TangCore"
expect-cursor-row 9
wait 1s
taps down 3 40ms 40ms
wait 300ms
expect-cursor-row 12 200ms
press down
press down
press down
press down
expect-cursor-row 16
press b
expect-screen "--- Options ---"
expect-cursor-row 9
wait 1s
taps down 3 40ms 40ms
wait 300ms
expect-cursor-row 12 200ms
